WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
- He's so fun, every time he comes.

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:04.310
He just came and we had
his uncle on here too.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.500
And it was so good.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.333
- [Nikki] Yeah. It's good.

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:07.640
- Yeah. But, I love you two.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.720
You both look like you're coming from

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.139
some really cool festival, always.

00:00:12.139 --> 00:00:12.972
(Nikki laughing)

00:00:12.972 --> 00:00:14.820
You look so put together and I'm like,

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.600
Oh, that's what people look
like sometimes, I guess.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.480
Not me.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.840
- We're doing the Earth Day episode,

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.530
so I guess it was tempting to come out

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:22.955
with hemp seeds in my hair.

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:24.070
- I think that's so cool though,

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:26.150
especially the companies that
you're wearing right now, too.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.330
I think that's so important.
- [Nikki] Thanks.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:28.850
- 'Cause you look bad-ass -
- [Nikki] Thanks.

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.370
- And what a great outfit

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:31.990
and also looking out for the planet.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.640
- My new jam is trying to figure

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.730
out how we can wear the same things

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.960
over and over again and
make them look different.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.303
- Well, Simon Cowell's been
doing that for quite some time.

00:00:40.303 --> 00:00:41.330
(both laughing)

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.163
He has been wearing

00:00:42.163 --> 00:00:44.440
the same black shirt and jeans

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:45.752
for, since I've known him.

00:00:45.752 --> 00:00:46.590
- He's a trendsetter.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.160
He's a real trendsetter.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.603
- [Kelly] He care's about the
earth more than all of us.

